<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/optimar/2.4> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "Ontology modelling structural elements, mooring systems, sensors, events, and failures in floating offshore wind platforms, including measurement data, involved actors, and semantic relationships between components. It reuses SOSA/SSN for observations, PROV-O for event and data provenance, and QUDT for quantities and units."@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "Ontología que modela los elementos estructurales, sistemas de amarre, sensores, eventos y fallos de plataformas eólicas offshore flotantes, incluyendo datos de medición, actores involucrados y relaciones semánticas entre componentes. Reutiliza SOSA/SSN para observaciones, PROV-O para la procedencia de eventos y datos y QUDT para cantidades y unidades."@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Flores, A., Garcia, O., & Aceta, C. (2026). Offshore Wind Power Platform Ontology for OPTiMAR (v2.4). DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.17962873"@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Flores, A., Garcia, O., & Aceta, C. (2026). Ontología de Plataforma Eólica Offshore para OPTiMAR (v2.4). DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.17962873"@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-09-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
