<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Oihana Garcia (Tekniker)" .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Esta ontología describe los componentes, fallos, sensores y eventos relacionados con las plataformas eólicas offshore flotantes."@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This ontology describes the components, failures, sensors, and events related to floating offshore wind platforms."@en .
