# https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/optimar#MooringLineDistribution> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Las líneas se agrupan en varios conjuntos alrededor de la plataforma."@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lines are grouped into several clusters around the platform."@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Clustered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#ClusteredDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Distribución agrupada"@es .
# 
# https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/optimar#MooringLineDistribution> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Las líneas están separadas por ángulos iguales alrededor de la plataforma."@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lines are separated by equal angles around the platform."@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Distribución uniforme"@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#EvenlyDistributed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evenly distributed"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/optimar#MooringLineDistribution> .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "All lines converge at a single point that allows the platform to rotate (weathervaning)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Todas las líneas convergen en un único punto que permite a la plataforma girar (weathervaning)."@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Amarre en un único punto"@es .
<https://w3id.org/optimar#SinglePointDistribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Single-point mooring"@en .
